# Radiometric equivalent-uranium (eU) color ramp — ppm eU.
# gdaldem color-relief format: <value> <r> <g> <b> [<a>]
# Sequential yellow→red; transparent for nodata. Stops tuned for the
# NURE Bayesian eU grid's typical CONUS range (~0-10 ppm, hot tail to
# ~15 in U-rich felsic-volcanic / roll-front provinces — Marysvale,
# Grants Mineral Belt, Wyoming Basin). The single most useful element
# grid for uranium prospecting; pairs with the U dots in MRDS/USMIN/CMMI.

nv 0 0 0 0
  0.0 255 252 200 0
  0.5 255 252 200 170
  1.5 254 230 140 200
  2.5 254 200 90 215
  3.5 253 160 50 220
  5.0 240 110 30 225
  7.0 215 60 20 230
 10.0 150 10 30 240
